-{#- DeepSeek-V4.1 chat template, ported from encoding/encoding.py in the model repo.
+{#- DeepSeek-V4.1 chat template, ported from encoding/encoding.py in the model repo (synced with its 2026-10-16 revision).
     Extra kwargs: thinking_mode ("thinking" | "chat", default "thinking"; enable_thinking=true/false is accepted
     as an alias), drop_thinking (default true), reasoning_effort (int in [1, 100] or "low"/"medium"/"high"/"max",
